ration-200 font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-100 font-normal"><span class="relative z-1">Agentic Commerce</span></button></li><li class="relative"><button type="button" class="relative w-full text-left text-body-sm rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200 font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-100 font-normal"><span class="relative z-1">Governance, Risk &amp; Regulatory Alignment</span></button></li><li class="relative"><button type="button" class="relative w-full text-left text-body-sm rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200 font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-100 font-normal"><span class="relative z-1">Identity &amp; Trust</span></button></li><li class="relative"><button type="button" class="relative w-full text-left text-body-sm rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200 font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-100 font-normal"><span class="relative z-1">Observability &amp; Traceability</span></button></li><li class="relative"><button type="button" class="relative w-full text-left text-body-sm rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200 font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-100 font-normal"><span class="relative z-1">Security &amp; Privacy</span></button></li><li class="relative"><button type="button" class="relative w-full text-left text-body-sm rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200 font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-100 font-normal"><span class="relative z-1">Workflows &amp; Process Integration</span></button></li><li class="relative"><button type="button" class="relative w-full text-left text-body-sm rounded-md cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200 font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-100 font-normal"><span class="relative z-1">Taxonomy &amp; Landscape</span></button></li></ul><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden lg:block absolute top-0 bottom-0 right-0 w-px bg-neutral-400/50 overflow-hidden"><span class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 bg-white" style="height:12.5%"></span></span></div><div class="w-full p-6 rounded-lg overflow-hidden" style="background:linear-gradient(96deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.10) 3.56%, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 85.71%)"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-stretch"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl min-h-90"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="opacity:1"><img alt="Accuracy &amp; Reliability image" loading="lazy" style="background-image:url(data:image/png;base64,);background-size:cover;background-position:center" class="object-cover object-center w-full h-full" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/3214352df5dc471f303b8c35975dc7cdb8e92829-1246x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=210&amp;q=75&amp;w=298 298w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/3214352df5dc471f303b8c35975dc7cdb8e92829-1246x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=420&amp;q=75&amp;w=595 595w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/3214352df5dc471f303b8c35975dc7cdb8e92829-1246x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=630&amp;q=75&amp;w=893 893w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/3214352df5dc471f303b8c35975dc7cdb8e92829-1246x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=786&amp;q=75&amp;w=1114 1114w" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/3214352df5dc471f303b8c35975dc7cdb8e92829-1246x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=420&amp;q=75&amp;w=595" width="595" height="420"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-center gap-y-6"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-y-2"><h3 class="text-white text-h1 font-normal" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px)">Accuracy &amp; Reliability</h3><p class="text-body-md text-neutral-100" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px)">Bringing operational rigor to agents — defining what reliability, accuracy, and consistency mean for autonomous system