-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl aspect-408/284"><img alt="Governance, Risk &amp; Regulatory Alignment image" loading="lazy" style="background-image:url(data:image/jpeg;base64,);background-size:cover;background-position:center" class="object-cover object-center w-full h-full" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/d119ea9cd8943d3bc73e17625e24af52996bec24-1245x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=142&amp;q=75&amp;w=204 204w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/d119ea9cd8943d3bc73e17625e24af52996bec24-1245x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=284&amp;q=75&amp;w=408 408w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/d119ea9cd8943d3bc73e17625e24af52996bec24-1245x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=426&amp;q=75&amp;w=612 612w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/d119ea9cd8943d3bc73e17625e24af52996bec24-1245x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=568&amp;q=75&amp;w=816 816w" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/d119ea9cd8943d3bc73e17625e24af52996bec24-1245x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=284&amp;q=75&amp;w=408" width="408" height="284"/></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-y-4 p-3"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-y-2"><h3 class="text-white text-h3 font-normal">Governance, Risk &amp; Regulatory Alignment</h3><p class="text-body-md text-neutral-100">Creating shared frameworks to align agentic innovation with legal, ethical, and regulatory expectations, including risk classification and regulatory mapping (e.g. the EU AI Act).</p></div><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-body-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer bg-white text-text border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg h-[3.625rem] px-[1.125rem] py-1 group" href="/working-groups/governance-risk-regulatory-alignment">View Working Group<div class="size-9 grid place-items-center relativ