;base64,);background-size:cover;background-position:center" class="object-cover object-center w-full h-full" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/1da6ac7196be51dc3f825e209923ba438a8d4131-1245x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=142&amp;q=75&amp;w=204 204w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/1da6ac7196be51dc3f825e209923ba438a8d4131-1245x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=284&amp;q=75&amp;w=408 408w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/1da6ac7196be51dc3f825e209923ba438a8d4131-1245x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=426&amp;q=75&amp;w=612 612w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/1da6ac7196be51dc3f825e209923ba438a8d4131-1245x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=568&amp;q=75&amp;w=816 816w" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/1da6ac7196be51dc3f825e209923ba438a8d4131-1245x786.webp?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=284&amp;q=75&amp;w=408" width="408" height="284"/></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-y-4 p-3"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-y-2"><h3 class="text-white text-h3 font-normal">Identity &amp; Trust</h3><p class="text-body-md text-neutral-100">Defining portable identity and dynamic trust for autonomous agents — delegation protocols, cross-domain identity, and how permissions flow across agent-to-agent interactions.</p></div><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-body-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer bg-white text-text border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg h-[3.625rem] px-[1.125rem] py-1 group" href="/working-groups/identity-trust">View Working Group<div class="size-9 grid place-items-center relative"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 23.387 23.387" width="1.5em" height="1.5em" aria-hidden="true" class="relative z-1 size-6 bg-white rounded-full"><path fill="#FF702D" d="M23.387 11.69