0c769372b358ab91a496f58-4640x6960.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=568&amp;q=75&amp;w=816 816w" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4o10fa7h/production/b985e32bf636052230c769372b358ab91a496f58-4640x6960.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=284&amp;q=75&amp;w=408" width="408" height="284"/></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-y-4 p-3"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-y-2"><h3 class="text-white text-h3 font-normal">Taxonomy &amp; Landscape</h3><p class="text-body-md text-neutral-100">This cross-working group workstream curates and maintains a glossary of agentic AI terms (the Taxonomy) and an ecosystem map (the Landscape) for the AAIF, so every Working Group can work from the same definitions and one view of the ecosystem.</p></div><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-body-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer bg-white text-text border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg h-[3.625rem] px-[1.125rem] py-1 group" href="/working-groups/taxonomy-landscape">View Working Group<div class="size-9 grid place-items-center relative"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 23.387 23.387" width="1.5em" height="1.5em" aria-hidden="true" class="relative z-1 size-6 bg-white rounded-full"><path fill="#FF702D" d="M23.387 11.693C23.387 5.235 18.15 0 11.693 0S0 5.235 0 11.693s5.235 11.694 11.693 11.694 11.694-5.236 11.694-11.694"></path><path fill="#fff" d="M7.989 5.571h2.147v2.147H7.989zM10.736 8.318h2.147v2.147h-2.147zM13.483 11.065h2.147v2.147h-2.147zM10.736 13.812h2.147v2.147h-2.147zM7.989 16.558h2.147v2.147H7.989z"></path></svg><span aria-hidden="true" class="swirl-dot absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -mt-[3px] -ml-[3px] size-1.5 bg-black pointer-events-none group-hover:[--swirl:1]" style="--swirl-end-x:-14px;--swirl-end-y:-14px;--swirl-arc-x:13px;--swirl-arc-y:1px"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="swirl-dot absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -mt-[3px] -ml-[3px] size-1.