or builders, contributors, and organizations advancing AI development with the Model Context Protocol (MCP). This year’s summit brings together MCP co-founders, contributors, and developers to explore the latest innovations, share best practices, and showcase the next generation of AI agents built on MCP.\",\"slug\":\"mcp-dev-summit-north-america\",\"startsAt\":\"2026-04-02T00:00:00\",\"endsAt\":\"2026-04-03T00:00:00\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"locationMode\":\"inPerson\",\"isVirtual\":false,\"locationLabel\":\"New York, United States\",\"venueAddress\":null,\"venueName\":null,\"joinUrl\":\"https://events.linuxfoundation.org/mcp-dev-summit-north-america/\",\"coordinates\":{\"lat\":40.71,\"lng\":-74.01},\"cityLabel\":\"New York\",\"cityCountry\":\"United States\",\"cityCountryCode\":\"US\",\"categories\":null,\"ctas\":[{\"key\":\"register\",\"label\":\"Register\",\"href\":\"https://events.linuxfoundation.org/mcp-dev-summit-north-america/register/\"},{\"key\":\"sponsor\",\"label\":\"Sponsor\",\"href\":\"https://events.linuxfoundation.org/mcp-dev-summit-north-america/sponsor/\"},{\"key\":\"schedule\",\"label\":\"Schedule\",\"href\":\"https://events.linuxfoundation.org/mcp-dev-summit-north-america/program/schedule/\"},{\"key\":\"learnMore\",\"label\":\"Learn More\",\"href\":\"https://events.linuxfoundation.org/mcp-dev-summit-north-america/\"}],\"imageUrl\":\"https://events.linuxfoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/mcp-na-26-social-snackable.png\"},{\"_id\":\"300321\",\"_type\":\"event\",\"title\":\"MCP Dev Summit Bengaluru\",\"summary\":\"A global series for developers building real-world agentic AI systems - from MCP and agent protocols to orchestration, infrastructure, \u0026 production deployment.\",\"slug\":\"mcp-dev-summit-bengaluru\",\"startsAt\":\"2026-06-09T00:00:00\",\"endsAt\":\"2026-06-10T00:00:00\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"locationMode\":\"inPerson\",\"isVirtual\":false,\"locationLabel\":\"Bengaluru, India\",\"venueAddress\":null,\"venueName\":null,\"joinUrl\":\